  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xe9;ponse d&#x2019;urgence aux besoins des personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es, retourn&#xe9;es et h&#xf4;tes affect&#xe9;es par la crise M23 dans la province du Nord-Kivu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide Protection and Shelter and Non-Food Items assistance to vulnerable communities affected by violence in the Rutshuru Territory of the Democratic Republic of Congo. This UNHCR project provides assistance for 43,727 people to meet their needs, including 8,308 women, 7,433 men, 27,986 children, and 6,599 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
